WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.963
The horseshoe tarot spread arranges seven
cards in an arch.

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:11.150
It looks at the past, the present, hidden influences,
you, others, advice and a likely direction.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:13.705
The seven positions.

00:00:13.705 --> 00:00:21.610
Cards are laid from left to right along the arch, so the first card
sits at the lower left and the seventh at the lower right.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:24.023
How the arch reads.

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:26.132
The shape helps with interpretation.

00:00:26.132 --> 00:00:28.123
The first two cards set the scene.

00:00:29.523 --> 00:00:31.943
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:31.943 --> 00:00:36.849
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
